module

public import
  MathlibExt.AlgebraicTopology.TopologicalSpace.ModelCategory.LegacyTopCat.TopCatHornSmallObject
public import Mathlib.CategoryTheory.MorphismProperty.WeakFactorizationSystem

/-!
# Horn weak factorization system in `TopCat`

This file is part of the KQ3 layer. It packages the small-object factorization
for `TopCat.realizedHornInclusions` as a weak factorization system with left
class `realizedHornInclusions.rlp.llp` and right class `realizedHornInclusions.rlp`,
via `IsWeakFactorizationSystem.mk'` with the inferred factorization
and retract-stability instances.

This does not identify either class with cofibrations, fibrations, trivial maps,
or weak equivalences and does not construct a model category.
-/

@[expose] public section

open CategoryTheory MorphismProperty

universe u

/-- Weak factorization system generated by the realized horns. -/
instance : IsWeakFactorizationSystem
    (TopCat.realizedHornInclusions.{u}).rlp.llp
    (TopCat.realizedHornInclusions.{u}).rlp :=
  IsWeakFactorizationSystem.mk' _ _ (fun _i p hi hp => hi p hp)
